      "description": "0 if **any** scrape in the last 2 h failed, and empty if the exporter has vanished entirely. That is `min_over_time`, not the last value: the level gauges are dropped rather than repeated on a failure, so this is the one place a dead exporter shows up. A plain `last_over_time` here would keep showing a stale 1 for up to 2 h after the target died.\n\nThe window exists because a 1 h `scrape_interval` against Prometheus's **5-minute** instant-query lookback would otherwise leave every stat panel on this dashboard empty for 55 minutes of every hour.",
